      "line_number": 65,
      "docstring": "Apply a ranking strategy:\n\n    \"bm25\"\n    \"dense\"\n    \"hybrid\"\n    anything else \u2192 hybrid\n\nAfter ranking, all candidates receive a deterministic \"rank\" field.\n\nThis function never mutates the caller\u2019s list.",
